@startuml
title Smart Healthcare Q&A Interaction Sequence (Dify-based System)

actor User
participant "Web UI" as WebUI
participant "Dify Backend" as Dify
participant "Knowledge Service" as Knowledge
participant "LLM Service" as LLM
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> WebUI : Input health question
WebUI -> Dify : Submit question request
Dify -> Knowledge : Search relevant documents
Knowledge -> DB : Query matching documents
DB --> Knowledge : Return matched documents
Knowledge --> Dify : Return knowledge content

Dify -> LLM : Prompt with embedded knowledge
LLM --> Dify : Return AI answer
Dify --> WebUI : Render final answer
WebUI --> User : Display diagnosis result

@enduml